  "expectedFailure": "H5-A: a break on a view inside a parent that fits on the page is ignored",
  "note": "Found by I13 (a neutral wrapper, internals/harness-r1/h5-mixed.md). Minimal form: page > [text, view > view(break) > text] gives 1 page; without the outer view, 2 pages. Likely cause: splitNodes in the layout copy looks at the children of a container only when that container overflows (shouldSplit), so a break deeper than the direct children of a splitting container is never seen. The chapters case (flow-chapters-break-in-wrapper.json) is fixed only for a wrapper that overflows. Not fixed (H5 does not fix engine bugs).",
